%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1bf5fd56daae6224299eebd748d911eb, type: 3}
  m_Name: TaxCodeBookData_Main
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaxCodeBookData
  sections:
  - heading: "Section 1 \u2013 Residency Status"
    body: '

      A Filipino citizen residing in the Philippines.

      Taxable
      on income in and outside the Philippines.




      A Filipino citizen residing
      or working abroad.

      Taxable only on income earned within the Philippines.



      A
      foreign national residing in the Philippines.

      Taxable only on income
      earned within the Philippines.




      A foreign national not residing in
      the Philippines.

      Taxable only on income earned within the Philippines.


'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: Resident Citizen
      enumValue: ResidentCitizen
      type: 2
      semanticKey: ResidencyStatus
    - displayText: Non-Resident Citizen
      enumValue: NonResidentCitizen
      type: 2
      semanticKey: ResidencyStatus
    - displayText: Resident Alien
      enumValue: ResidentAlien
      type: 2
      semanticKey: ResidencyStatus
    - displayText: Non-Resident Alien
      enumValue: NonResidentAlien
      type: 2
      semanticKey: ResidencyStatus
  - heading: "Section 2 \u2013 Taxpayer Type"
    body: '

      Earns income from employment.





      Earns income from operating
      a business.




      Earns income from providing professional services independently.




      Earns
      both employment income and business or professional income.


'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: Compensation Earner
      enumValue: CompensationEarner
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxpayerType
    - displayText: Self-Employed
      enumValue: SelfEmployed
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxpayerType
    - displayText: Professional
      enumValue: Professional
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxpayerType
    - displayText: Mixed Income Earner
      enumValue: MixedIncomeEarner
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxpayerType
  - heading: "Section 3 \u2013 Income Sources"
    body: '

      Income received from an employer.





      Taxpayer has only
      one employer during the taxable year.



      Taxpayer has two or more employers
      during the taxable year.




      Income earned from business activities.





      Income
      earned from professional services.




      Combination of multiple income
      sources.


'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: Employment Income
      enumValue: EmploymentIncome
      type: 2
      semanticKey: IncomeSource
    - displayText: One Employer
      enumValue: OneEmployer
      type: 2
      semanticKey: EmployerCount
    - displayText: Multiple Employers
      enumValue: MultipleEmployers
      type: 2
      semanticKey: EmployerCount
    - displayText: Business Income
      enumValue: BusinessIncome
      type: 2
      semanticKey: IncomeSource
    - displayText: Professional Income
      enumValue: ProfessionalIncome
      type: 2
      semanticKey: IncomeSource
    - displayText: Mixed Income
      enumValue: MixedIncome
      type: 2
      semanticKey: IncomeSource
  - heading: "Section 4 \u2013 Business Registration"
    body: '

      A valid BIR Form 2303 exists.





      No business registration
      document exists.



'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: Registered
      enumValue: Registered
      type: 2
      semanticKey: BusinessRegistration
    - displayText: Not Registered
      enumValue: NotRegistered
      type: 2
      semanticKey: BusinessRegistration
  - heading: "Section 5 \u2013 Tax Options"
    body: '

      Tax is computed using income tax brackets under the National Internal
      Revenue Code.




      Optional tax rate available to qualified self-employed
      individuals and professionals.



      Reference:

      Republic Act No.
      10963 (TRAIN Law)


'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: Graduated Tax Rate
      enumValue: GraduatedTaxRate
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxOption
    - displayText: 8% Tax Rate
      enumValue: EightPercentTaxRate
      type: 2
      semanticKey: TaxOption
  - heading: "Section 6 \u2013 Required Supporting Documents"
    body: 'BIR Form 2316

      Verifies employment income and tax withheld.


      BIR
      Form 2303

      Verifies business registration and tax type.


      Financial
      Statements

      Verify sales, expenses, and net income.


      Sales Records

      Verify
      declared revenue.


      Bank Statements

      Verify deposits and cash flow.


      Property
      Documents

      Verify property transactions.


      Previous Year''s ITR

      Verify
      prior declarations and compliance history.


'
    clickableValues: []
  - heading: "Section 7 \u2013 Income Tax Computation"
    body: "Gross Income\nTotal income earned before deductions.\n\nAllowable Expenses\nQualified
      expenses that may reduce taxable income.\n\nTaxable Income\nIncome subject
      to tax.\n\nFormula:\nTaxable Income = Gross Income \u2212 Allowable Expenses\n\nTax
      Due\nTax computed using the applicable tax rate.\n\nTax Withheld / Tax Credits\nTaxes
      already paid or withheld.\n\nFinal Tax Payable\nRemaining tax due after deductions.\n\nFormula:\nFinal
      Tax Payable = Tax Due \u2212 Tax Credits\n\n"
    clickableValues: []
  - heading: "Section 8 \u2013 Form Selection Guide"
    body: '

      Used by Compensation Earners.





      Used by Self-Employed,
      Professionals, and Mixed Income Earners using Graduated Tax Rates.



      Used
      by qualified Self-Employed Individuals and Professionals using the 8% Tax Rate.


'
    clickableValues:
    - displayText: BIR1700
      enumValue: BIR1700
      type: 2
      semanticKey: RequiredForm
    - displayText: BIR1701
      enumValue: BIR1701
      type: 2
      semanticKey: RequiredForm
    - displayText: BIR1701A
      enumValue: BIR1701A
      type: 2
      semanticKey: RequiredForm
  - heading: "Section 9 \u2013 Common Tax Issues"
    body: 'Missing Income

      Income appears in documents but was not declared.


      Income
      Mismatch

      Different documents show conflicting income amounts.


      Multiple
      Employers

      More than one employer appears in records.


      Unregistered
      Business

      Business income exists but no registration is found.


      Large
      Unexplained Deposits

      Bank deposits exceed reported income.


      Missing
      Documents

      Required documents are incomplete.


'
    clickableValues: []
  - heading: "Section 10 \u2013 Case Assessment Guide"
    body: 'Under Review

      Additional verification is required.


      Ready
      for Computation

      Enough information exists to calculate taxes.


      Ready
      for Filing

      Classification, computation, and documentation are complete.


      Filed

      The
      tax return has been successfully prepared and submitted.


'
    clickableValues: []
  - heading: "Section 11 \u2013 Interview Guide"
    body: 'Determine Residency Status

      Ask where the taxpayer resides or works.


      Determine
      Taxpayer Type

      Ask how the taxpayer earns income.


      Determine Income
      Sources

      Identify all income earned during the taxable year.


      Determine
      Business Registration

      Verify whether the taxpayer operates a registered
      business.


      Determine Tax Option

      Verify tax type using BIR Form
      2303 and taxpayer information.


      Clarify Inconsistencies

      Ask about
      missing documents, unusual deposits, or income discrepancies.


'
    clickableValues: []
  - heading: "Section 12 \u2013 Compliance Checklist"
    body: "Before marking a case Ready for Filing:\n\n\u2713 Residency Status Determined\n\u2713
      Taxpayer Type Determined\n\u2713 Income Source Determined\n\u2713 Business
      Registration Verified\n\u2713 Tax Option Verified\n\u2713 Supporting Documents
      Verified\n\u2713 Tax Computation Completed\n\u2713 Correct BIR Form Selected\n\u2713
      No Unresolved Issues Remain\n\n"
    clickableValues: []
